projector,\n            action_head=action_head,\n            use_film=use_film,\n        )\n        \n    return [action[i] for i in range(len(action))]\n```\n\n---\n\n### **Key Files to Reference**\n\n- **Model Loading & Inference**: `/experiments/robot/openvla_utils.py` (30KB)\n- **Training Loop**: `/vla-scripts/finetune.py`\n- **LIBERO Evaluation**: `/experiments/robot/libero/run_libero_eval.py`\n- **ALOHA Robot Evaluation**: `/experiments/robot/aloha/run_aloha_eval.py`\n- **Robot Utilities**: `/experiments/robot/robot_utils.py`\n\n---\n\n### **For Token Importance Analysis**\n\nTo analyze token importance, you'll need:\n\n1. **Enable attention outputs** via `output_attentions=True`\n2. **Capture hidden states** via `output_hidden_states=True`\n3. **Identify vision tokens** using `num_patches` (first `num_patches` tokens)\n4. **Extract action-relevant tokens** from the response portion (after text tokens)\n5. **Compute importance metrics** over attention heads and layers, focusing on how vision tokens influence action prediction\n\nThe vision tokens appear at positions `[0:num_patches]` and feed into the LLM which generates text, whose hidden states are then fed to the action head for continuous/diffusion-based action prediction."}],"totalDurationMs":241221,"totalTokens":40764,"totalToolUseCount":63,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":565,"cache_read_input_tokens":37306,"output_tokens":2891,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":565},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2891,"cache_read_input_tokens":37306,"cache_creation_input_tokens":565,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":565,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":0,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":0,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":63}}}
